B.a_f=new A.d6("The Blue Kite","Mia has a blue kite. A soft wind lifts it high. The kite dips, spins, and climbs. Mia holds the string with both hands. Her kite sails above the park.")
B.a_d=new A.d6("A Helpful Pup","Pip is a small brown dog. He sees a red ball by the gate. Pip picks it up and trots home. His tail wags all the way. What a helpful pup!")
B.a_i=new A.d6("Garden Day","We dig small holes in the soil. We plant one seed in each hole. Then we add a little water. Soon green leaves peek out. Our garden has begun to grow.")
B.a_1=new A.d6("The Lost Sock","One yellow sock sat on the chair. Its match was not in the drawer. Leo looked under the bed. There it was beside a toy train. The pair was together again.")
B.a__=new A.d6("Rainy-Day Fort","Rain taps on the window. We build a fort with chairs and sheets. A lamp glows inside. We read books and eat apple slices. Our cozy fort feels like a tiny home.")
B.a_j=new A.d6("Duck Parade","A mother duck walks by the pond. Six little ducks follow in a line. They step over a stick and around a rock. Then they all splash into the cool water.")
B.a_e=new A.d6("The Big Sandwich","Noah makes lunch for a picnic. He adds cheese, tomato, and crisp lettuce. The sandwich is very tall. He cuts it into four parts so everyone can share.")
B.a_h=new A.d6("Moon Shapes","The moon looks round tonight. Last week it looked like a thin smile. We draw each shape in a notebook. The moon changes, but it is always the same moon.")
